        <div class="cc-cta-eyebrow" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/computer-crimes.astro:mbqbud"><span class="cc-cta-line" aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/computer-crimes.astro:iqlqea"></span>Consultation</div>
        <h2 data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/computer-crimes.astro:w4b5ar">Whatever the charge, talk to us first.</h2>
